    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d830">

                <pb facs="0915" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg823"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/1854a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Special Agent at Corfu</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dodge</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-07T18:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department desires from time to time confidential reports on Serbian Government’s
                    position as to character of relation to be established between Serbia and
                    Jugo-Slav portion of Austria-Hungary if latter secure their liberty.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
